#: Game/Levels/FamUnion/L01proveexists.lean:70
msgid ""
"**The proof, written out.**\n"
"\n"
"> We need a set §0 such that §1.  Take §2: every set is a subset of itself.\n"
"\n"
"To prove that something exists, you name an example (a *witness*) and show that it has the\n"
"required property.  §3 does exactly that: §4 is the witness, and §5 shows that\n"
"it works.\n"
"\n"
"By the way, another set that works as a witness for the existential goal in this theorem is the\n"
"empty set, §6.  To justify the use of that witness, you can use the theorem §7 from\n"
"Complement World: §8 is also a proof of the goal.\n"
"\n"
"Now that you know how to prove existential statements, you're ready to start working with\n"
"unions of families."
msgstr ""
"**La demostración, por escrito.**\n"
"\n"
"> Necesitamos un conjunto §0 tal que §1.  Tomemos §2: todo conjunto es subconjunto de sí mismo.\n"
"\n"
"Para demostrar que algo existe, das un ejemplo (un *testigo*) y muestras que tiene la\n"
"propiedad requerida.  §3 hace exactamente eso: §4 es el testigo, y §5 muestra que\n"
"funciona.\n"
"\n"
"Por cierto, otro conjunto que funciona como testigo para el objetivo existencial en este teorema es\n"
"el conjunto vacío, §6. Para justificar el uso de ese testigo, puedes usar el teorema §7 del\n"
"Mundo de los complementarios: §8 también es una prueba del objetivo.\n"
"\n"
"Ahora que sabes cómo probar enunciados existenciales, estás listo para comenzar a trabajar con\n"
"uniones de familias."

