#: Game/Levels/Comp/L01contra.lean:65
msgid ""
"For the theorem in this level, your goal is §0, which Lean reads as §1:\n"
"it is not the case that §2 is a subset of §3.  To use proof by contradiction\n"
"in this proof, you must begin by introducing the assumption §4.  To do that, type\n"
"§5"
msgstr ""
"Para el teorema en este nivel, tu objetivo es §0, que Lean lee como §1:\n"
"no es cierto que §2 sea un subconjunto de §3. Para utilizar la prueba por contradicción\n"
"en esta demostración, debes comenzar introduciendo la suposición §4. Para hacerlo, escribe\n"
"§5."

