"If you have §0, §1, and §2, then §3 is a proof of the\n"
"statement §4.\n"
"In Mathlib, the name of this theorem is §5."
msgstr ""
"Si tienes §0, §1, y §2, entonces §3 es una prueba del\n"
"enunciado §4.\n"
"En Mathlib, el nombre de este teorema es §5."

