#. §5: `A`
#. §6: `U`
#. §7: `A`
#. §8: `Aᶜ`
#: Game/Levels/Comp.lean:19
msgid ""
"If §0 is a set of objects from the universe §1, then the *complement* of §2,\n"
"denoted §3, is the set of all objects in the universe §4 that are *not*\n"
"elements of §5.\n"
"\n"
"For example, if §6 consists of all people and §7 is the set of people who are more than\n"
"6 feet tall, then §8 is the set of all people who are at most 6 feet tall.\n"
"\n"
"In this world, we'll see how to prove theorems about complements."
msgstr ""
"Si §0 es un conjunto de objetos del universo §1, entonces el *complementario* de §2,\n"
"denotado §3, es el conjunto de todos los objetos en el universo §4 que no son\n"
"elementos de §5.\n"
"\n"
"Por ejemplo, si §6 consiste en todas las personas y §7 es el conjunto de personas que miden más de 2 metros, entonces §8 es el conjunto de todas las personas que miden a lo sumo 2 metros.\n"
"\n"
"En este mundo, veremos cómo probar teoremas sobre complementarios."

#. §0: `A`
#. §1: `U`
#. §2: `Aᶜ`
#. §3: `A`
#. §4: `Aᶜ`
#. §5: `U`
#. §6: `A`
#. §7: `ᶜ`
#. §8: `\\compl`
#. §9: `\\^c`
#: Game/Levels/Comp/L02compdef.lean:41
msgid ""
"If §0 is a set of objects from the universe §1, then §2 is the complement of §3; that is,\n"
"§4 is the set of objects from §5 that are not elements of §6.  You can enter the symbol §7\n"
"by typing §8 or §9."
msgstr ""
"Si §0 es un conjunto de objetos del universo §1, entonces §2 es el complementario de §3;\n"
"es decir, §4 es el conjunto de objetos de §5 que no son elementos de §6. Puedes ingresar el\n"
"símbolo §7 escribiendo §8 o §9."

