#. §4: `⋂₀ F ⊆ A`
#. §5: `Set.sInter_subset_of_mem`
#: Game/Levels/FamInter/L01intersub.lean:66
#: Game/Levels/FamUnion/L02subunion.lean:54
msgid ""
"If §0 is a set, §1 is a family of sets, and §2, then §3 is a\n"
"proof of §4.  In Mathlib, the name of this theorem is §5."
msgstr ""
"Si §0 es un conjunto, §1 es una familia de conjuntos y §2, entonces §3 es una\n"
"prueba de §4. En Mathlib, el nombre de este teorema es §5."

