#: Game/Levels/FamInter/L01intersub.lean:39
msgid ""
"If §0 represents a statement about an unspecified object §1, then §2 means\n"
"\"for all §3, §4 is true\".  To enter the symbol §5, type §6.\n"
"\n"
"### If your goal is §7\n"
"\n"
"The tactic §8 will introduce a new object §9 into the proof, and set the goal to be §10.\n"
"Be sure to use a variable §11 that is not already being used to stand for some object.\n"
"\n"
"### If you have an assumption §12\n"
"\n"
"If §13 stands for some object, then §14 is a proof of §15.  Note that §16 must be the\n"
"right *type* of object.  For example, if §17 stands for an object in the universe §18, then\n"
"§19 must have type §20; if §21 stands for a set of objects from the universe §22, then §23 must\n"
"have type §24."
msgstr ""
"Si §0 representa una afirmación sobre un objeto sin especificar §1, entonces §2 significa\n"
"\"Para todo §3, se cumple §4\".  Para introducir el símbolo §5, teclea §6.\n"
"\n"
"### Si tu objetivo es §7\n"
"\n"
"La táctica §8 introducirá un nuevo objeto §9 en la prueba, y establecerá que el objetivo pase a ser §10.\n"
"Asegúrate de usar una variable §11 que no esté ya siendo usada para otro objeto.\n"
"\n"
"### Si tienes una hipótesis §12\n"
"\n"
"Si §13 representa un objeto, entonces §14 es una prueba de §15.  Notar que §16 debe ser un objeto del  *tipo* adecuado.\n"
"Por ejemplo, si §17 es un objeto del universo §18, entonces\n"
"§19 debe ser del tipo §20; si §21 representa un conjunto de objetos del universo §22, entonces §23 debe ser del tipo §24."

#. §0: `P x`
#. §1: `x`
