"If §0, then §1.  Use §2 to assert that, and then see what §3\n"
"tells you."
msgstr "Si §0, entonces §1. Usa §2 para afirmarlo, y luego mira qué te dice §3."

#: Game/Levels/Subset/L04imp.lean:11
msgid "Implication"
msgstr "Implicaciones"

#. §0: `⋃₀ (F ∪ G)`
#: Game/Levels/FamInter/L04interunion.lean:52
msgid "In Family Union World you'll prove a similar theorem about §0."
msgstr "En el Mundo de la unión de familias demostrarás un teorema similar sobre §0."

#. §0: `obtain`
#. §1: `t`
#: Game/Levels/FamUnion/L05unionunion.lean:44
msgid "In each case, §0 will give you a set §1 that you can use as the witness for the goal."
msgstr "En cada caso, §0 te dará un conjunto §1 que puedes usar como testigo para el objetivo."

#. §0: `P → Q`
#. §1: `intro h`
#. §2: `h : P`
#. §3: `Q`
#. §4: `h1 : P → Q`
#. §5: `h2 : P`
