#: Game/Levels/Subset/L05subref.lean:33
msgid ""
"Our first step is to introduce an object §0 into the proof.  To do this, type §1.\n"
"We have already seen that the §2 tactic can be used to introduce a new *assumption* into a\n"
"proof.  This step illustrates a second use of §3: introducing a new *object* into a proof."
msgstr ""
"Nuestro primer paso es introducir un objeto §0 en la prueba. Para hacer esto,\n"
"  escribe §1. Ya hemos visto que la táctica §2 se puede utilizar para introducir\n"
