#: Game/Levels/FamUnion/L02subunion.lean:62
msgid ""
"Remember that the goal §0 is an abbreviation for\n"
"§1.  As we saw in the last level, we can prove this by coming up with\n"
"a witness--that is, a value for §2 that will make the statement §3 come out\n"
"true.  Looking at\n"
"§4 and §5, it looks like §6 would work.  That suggests a way to proceed:\n"
"§7 would prove the goal, if §8 were a proof of §9.  In\n"
"other words, if §10 is applied to a proof of §11, then it will\n"
"prove the goal.  So if you use the tactic §12, then Lean will\n"
"set §13 as your new goal."
msgstr ""
" Recuerda que el objetivo §0 es una abreviatura para\n"
"§1. Como vimos en el último nivel, podemos probar esto creando\n"
"un testigo, es decir, un valor para §2 que haga verdadera la declaración §3.\n"
"Si miramos\n"
"§4 y §5, parece que §6 funcionaría. Esto sugiere una forma de proceder:\n"
"§7 probaría el objetivo, si §8 fuera una prueba de §9. En\n"
"otros términos, si se aplica §10 a una prueba de §11, entonces probará\n"
"el objetivo. Por lo tanto, si utilizas la táctica §12, entonces Lean establecerá\n"
"§13 como tu nuevo objetivo."

#. §0: `«{h2}» : ∀ t ∈ F, «{x}» ∈ t`
