"\n"
"**A dictionary.**  Each operation on sets matches a word of logic:\n"
"\n"
"* §0 means §1 (\"and\")\n"
"* §2 means §3 (\"or\")\n"
"* §4 means §5 (\"not\")\n"
"* §6 means §7 (\"for all\" and \"if … then\")\n"
"\n"
